The international community looks to China for wisdom and solutions, hoping that China’s development will bring new opportunities to the world.
Liu said that China is now pushing forward technological innovation, injecting new energy into economic and social development, raising capital, talent development, and policy incentives, which will keep China in a dynamic position in the new five-year plan.
