Amazon shipping problems
After receiving the goods, I found that:
1. The packaging is severely worn out.
2. The table of contents is seriously misformatted.
3. The clock does not move; the lamp cannot be charged and used, nor can it adjust time.
4. Contact Amazon customer service separately, and you can only send it to the US at your own expense, and then pay for the postage.
5. The reason for getting two stars is that customer service was good.
When I first bought it, something was wrong, all the lights were flashing and it was not working.
To request a refund, it took three days to get the goods to Shanghai and they still haven't been delivered.
I called the delivery person, but they didn’t answer.
The courier company said that they only had that contact information.
Amazon cannot find a place to lodge a complaint.
I have been asked to postpone delivery without asking, and it is not surprising that I am asked to postpone delivery - text messages like this come in.
The problem of transit was also mentioned later.
Anyway, the terrible shopping experience made me start to doubt the effectiveness of Amazon's logistics system and control system.
I don't think I can get it today.
